## Install

Download {{ mod_name }} from its
[releases](https://github.com/{{ repository }}/releases) and put it in your game
folder, as the [install guide](https://enshwick.github.io/docs/guides/install/)
shows. It runs on enshwick.

## Settings

You change these values in the game, as the
[settings guide](https://enshwick.github.io/docs/guides/change-mod-settings/)
shows.

## Problems

**Something goes wrong.** Open an issue in the
[mod's repository](https://github.com/{{ repository }}/issues). Attach the files
from the `logs/enshwick/` folder in your game folder.
